            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Dilo 1.1.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Pin key moments in meetings:</strong> press fn+P, or the pin button in the meeting panel, whenever something important is said. The lines around each pin are highlighted in the transcript (and in Obsidian), and the summary opens with a new Key moments section.</li>
  <li>Remove a pin from the transcript margin or from Key moments. Exports mark pinned lines with ★.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
